---
title: input_decoding (EIP-7951)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_read_h : h = BigEndian(bytes[0..32])
    q_read_h --> q_read_r : r = BigEndian(bytes[32..64])
    q_read_r --> q_read_s : s = BigEndian(bytes[64..96])
    q_read_s --> q_read_qx : qx = BigEndian(bytes[96..128])
    q_read_qx --> q_read_qy : qy = BigEndian(bytes[128..160])
    q_read_qy --> [*] : decoding complete

    note right of q_read_h
        INV-016: Input is exactly 160 bytes (5 x 32-byte fields)
        INV-017: All fields use BigEndian encoding
        INV-018: Field order is h, r, s, qx, qy
    end note
